/**
 * ledger.ts — Physical Conservation Ledger & Stoichiometric Accounting Engine
 * 
 * "Bảo toàn, Mất đi, Còn lại"
 * Tracks exact mass, element atom counts, charge neutrality, enthalpy balance,
